  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Fixed\n- Template update now removes the files listed in cleanup.files first for every repository, including those without a changelog, independent of later update steps, and logs each file it removes (#360)\n- Package, dependency, template and code clean-up caches are now saved even when the update is cancelled, so work completed before cancellation is no longer lost; each save is isolated so one failing save no longer prevents the others from running (#247)",
